{"id": "q0201", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3757920688, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "Statement 1| Layer Normalization is used in the original ResNet paper, not Batch Normalization. Statement 2| DCGANs use self-attention to stabilize training.\n\nA. Statement 2 is True, but it's not clear about Statement 1\nB. Statement 1 and 2 are both partially true and partially false\nC. Statement 1 is False, but it's not clear about Statement 2\nD. False, True\nE. Statement 1 is True, but it's not clear about Statement 2\nF. True, True\nG. Statement 2 is False, but it's not clear about Statement 1\nH. True, False\nI. Both Statements are unclear\nJ. False, False\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0201.wav", "input_sha256": "c07497db68f5f5ad10653bf0a991f8a034ddb41b8fe003af41f98ff9991a73ae", "input_samples": 633000, "input_s": 39.562, "n_real_chunks": 40, "score": 0.6684, "act": 0.9906, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "Let's take a look at statement one. La yer normal ization is used in the original ResNet paper, not batch normalization. That' s actually false. The original Re sNet paper introduced batch normal ization to help with training deep networks. Layer normalization came later and is more commonly used in transform er models. So statement one is incorrect. Now let' s look at statement two: DC GANs use self- attention to stabilize training. D CGANs are an older generative model that uses standard convolutional layers, but they do not incorporate self- attention mechanisms. Self- attention was popularized in later models like Transformers. So statement two is also false. Since both statements are false, the correct answer is J. False, false.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 40, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 40, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0201_local_local.wav", "sha256": "ac11dee0f388664ec64015ba29e71e338b0430ecb19735abf42e82cc0f83ed35", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 40.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.059, 1.107, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.059, 2.106, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.059, 3.106, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.059, 4.107, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.061, 5.109, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.059, 6.107, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.061, 7.11, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.061, 8.11, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.062, 9.111, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.061, 10.109, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.064, 11.113, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.061, 12.11, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.061, 13.11, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.062, 14.111, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.063, 15.112, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.063, 16.112, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 17.0, 17.063, 17.111, 1, 0, 0], [17, 1, 18.0, 18.062, 18.11, 1, 0, 0], [18, 1, 19.0, 19.065, 19.113, 1, 0, 0], [19, 1, 20.0, 20.064, 20.112, 1, 0, 0], [20, 1, 21.0, 21.065, 21.114, 1, 0, 0], [21, 1, 22.0, 22.066, 22.114, 1, 0, 0], [22, 1, 23.0, 23.066, 23.116, 1, 0, 0], [23, 1, 24.0, 24.065, 24.114, 1, 0, 0], [24, 1, 25.0, 25.067, 25.115, 1, 0, 0], [25, 1, 26.0, 26.066, 26.114, 1, 0, 0], [26, 1, 27.0, 27.068, 27.117, 1, 0, 0], [27, 1, 28.0, 28.066, 28.115, 1, 0, 0], [28, 1, 29.0, 29.068, 29.116, 1, 0, 0], [29, 1, 30.0, 30.065, 30.114, 1, 0, 0], [30, 1, 31.0, 31.066, 31.115, 1, 0, 0], [31, 1, 32.0, 32.064, 32.113, 1, 0, 0], [32, 1, 33.0, 33.065, 33.114, 1, 0, 0], [33, 1, 34.0, 34.066, 34.115, 1, 0, 0], [34, 1, 35.0, 35.066, 35.116, 1, 0, 0], 