{"id": "q0530", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2258117728, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "923cbbdfe3213927dfa36b1f8e0eb48a30d641d9b9bf7cf25d16765340d88836", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "描述数据存储的各种方法。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0530.wav", "input_sha256": "d3c9a18d8228694bfb13f92c0a870308de19457a769f2b28f54544da1257bed9", "input_samples": 37400, "input_s": 2.337, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.3158, "act": 0.9961, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "数据存储的方法有很多种，主要取决于数据的类型、使用场景和访问需求。常见的存储方式包括硬盘驱动器，比如SSD和HDD，它们用来保存文件、文档和媒体内容。还有云存储服务，像阿里云、腾云等，可以通过网络远程存储大量数据，方便多人共享和备份。另外，数据库系统也非常重要，比如关系型数据库MySQL或者NoSQL数据库如MongoDB，专门用于管理结构化或非结构化的数据。还有快照和镜像技术，能够定期保存数据状态，防止意外丢失。当然，不同的存储方案也有优缺点，需要根据具体需求来选择。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 49, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0530_local_local.wav", "sha256": "1f8eb753444ae1df019410ac04cc87ea649cab6931a1f1b904628406571e8153", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 48.84}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.054, 1.098, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.055, 2.099, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.337, 2.395, 2.439, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.337, 3.395, 3.846, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.338, 4.397, 4.939, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.338, 5.398, 5.902, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.338, 6.398, 6.963, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.338, 7.395, 7.904, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.338, 8.397, 8.924, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.338, 9.398, 9.895, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.338, 10.399, 10.953, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.338, 11.401, 11.887, 0, 